<title>USA: MAPCO, Texaco to co-own Discovery Project.</title>
<headline>MAPCO, Texaco to co-own Discovery Project.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAPCO Inc said on Monday it will join Texaco Inc in building and operating the Discovery Project natural gas pipeline and processing complex, with each company owning 50 percent.</p>
<p>The $300 million project is located in southern Louisiana and offshore in the Gulf of Mexico. The project is expected to begin accepting natural gas in late 1997.</p>
</text>
